 that  within that we have now created a space  to find a solution  by suspending the eu counter measures  for six months  so this gives us room to sit down to  discuss more detailed  uh to find a solution that preserves our  industry  and that restores our historical trade  flows  and we are aware and our american  friends are also aware that we need to  do this before the suspension of our  counter measures expire  thank you um lotte you're next  thank you lotta mile from tv to denmark  for both  presidents what is the eu message  on russia for for biden to take along  to his meeting with putin tomorrow thank  you  the the first the first message is very  simple  we are united the 27 member states we  had  an in-depth debate a few weeks ago about  russia and we condemn  the illegal activities the disruptive  activities  of russia point one point two we want to  implement the five guiding principles  especially we think it's important to  play a strong role  uh at the level of the eastern  partnership but also in the western  balkans in order to support  robust democratic institutions in those  countries and indeed i think that with  united states with  some other like-minded partners it's  important not only to react  when we face authoritarian regimes  trying to put pressure on us  it's important to have a proactive  strategy in order to promote  our values and to defend our interests  yes indeed russia is europe's biggest  neighbor  and we have uh we are very clearly  united in our approach  to our uh biggest neighbor we must say  that the eu-russia  relationship is currently more on the  negative spiral  and you're all aware of the development  of the last years  um we would like to turn that  into if i may say some more predictable  relationship and we are very clear that  there are  three ways to approach that here too  clear push back on breaches of  international law  clear pushback on breaches of human  rights  secondly to constrain russia's attempts  to u